'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\12 - Remove Duplicates
' Version    : 4.5.0 + unreleased addition (see CHANGELOG "Unreleased"; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunRemoveDuplicates).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: open the agent, click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this
'              WHOLE file, Ctrl+S. Designer puts each part in its place automatically.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunRemoveDuplicates):
'
' Removes UNREGISTERED Person documents that are FULL duplicates of a registered user.
' Input: RECON_<run>_duplicates.csv from 09 - Reconcile. Only DO_NOT_REGISTER rows are candidates.
' Every candidate is re-checked live; it is removed only if name, short name (ops number), Internet address,
' first and last name (DuplicateMustMatch) are the same as the keeper's, the keeper is registered with an
' existing mail file, and the candidate is in no open batch, has no ID file and no mail file of its own.
'   DryRun=1 (default): writes DEDUP_DRYRUN_<run>.csv (WOULD_REMOVE / SKIP_* per row), changes nothing.
'   DryRun=0          : asks you to type REMOVE, writes a DXL snapshot of each document to <PasswordDir>\DEDUP_<run>\,
'                       then removes it (DuplicateDeleteMethod: ADMINP request, DIRECT delete, or AUTO).
' Never deletes mail files, ID files, vault IDs or the keeper. STOP.txt in BatchDir stops it after the current chunk.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunRemoveDuplicates()
End Sub
